msgid "More themes to set a CV in, beside Postulo's own: a CV laid out as the Europass CV is. Switched off, the themes are no longer offered, and a document set in one of them is drawn in the plain theme until it is switched on again."
msgstr "Téamaí níos mó chun CV a leagan isteach, in aice le Postulo féin: CV a leagtar amach mar an CV Europass. Athraigh amach, níl na téamaí ar fáil a thuilleadh, agus tarraingíodh doiciméad atá leagtha i gceann acu sa téama plain go dtí go ndéantar é a athrú arís."

